{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Citybus o530 Facelift add-on for OMSI 2, depicts one of the most popular buses in Europe in its modernized versions. Choose your favorite bus from 268 versions and 670 built-in repaints of the exterior and interior with upholstery from many cities. Personalize it with 83 setvars, offering 236 options of configuration, such as the type of seats, dashboard, displays, air conditioning, door type, and much more. Setvars can be configured in-game by a dedicated panel in the bus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vehicles represent city and suburban types in standard configuration (K, solo, CNG, \u00dc, M\u00dc, L, L\u00dc, G, G\u00dc, G CNG, GL) and in low entry variants (LE, LE \u00dc, LE M\u00dc) with realistic 3D models, textures, and sounds. Versions differ in length, door arrangement, engines, and gearboxes. In addition, each version is available with the Metro Design look, mainly used on articulated versions for BRT systems. Buses have adjustable mirrors and a dashboard. Realistic control panels (two types) and a ticket printer manufactured in Poland (available in English, Polish, and German).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Realistic sounds for 6 engines: OM 906 hLA, OM 926 LA, OM 457 hLA, OM 457 hLA LE, OM 457 LA, M 447 hLAG (CNG), and 8 gearboxes: D854.3/D864.3, D854.5/D864.5, 6HP502/6HP602 and 6AP1200/6AP1700.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837800/extras/omsi_features.png?t=1754396424\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">268 versions, differences:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lengths: 10m (K), 12m (solo, CNG, \u00dc, LE, LE \u00dc), 13m (M\u00dc, LE M\u00dc), 15m (L, L\u00dc), 18m articulated (G, G\u00dc, G CNG), 19m articulated (GL)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Door arrangement city: solo 2-2-0, 2-2-2; articulated 2-2-2-0, 2-2-2-2</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Door arrangement suburban: solo 1-2-0, 2-2-0; articulated 1-2-2-0, 2-2-2-0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Door arrangement low entry: 1-2-0, 2-2-0, 1-2-1, 2-2-1</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engines: 6 types (different sounds for each)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gearboxes: 8 types (different sounds)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Ingame setvar configurator panel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adjustable mirrors and dashboard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Realistic control panel (two types) and ticket printer from Poland (available in English, Polish and German)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">83 setvars with 236 options of configuration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">670 realistic and semi realistic repaints of exterior and interior with different upholstery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Realistic 3d model, textures and sounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buses are repaintable</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3837800?t=1754396424","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837800/af3856c5c02dfbcb177800741f872b80164e8bf6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754396424","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837800/550d3b8a41aae990563f7540033dd1758e0ff198/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754396424","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837800/550d3b8a41aae990563f7540033dd1758e0ff198/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754396424","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes"