L)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Door arrangement city: solo 2-2-0, 2-2-2; articulated 2-2-2-0, 2-2-2-2</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Door arrangement suburban: solo 1-2-0, 2-2-0; articulated 1-2-2-0, 2-2-2-0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Door arrangement low entry: 1-2-0, 2-2-0, 1-2-1, 2-2-1</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engines: 6 types (different sounds for each)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gearboxes: 8 types (different sounds)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Ingame setvar configurator panel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adjustable mirrors and dashboard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Realistic control panel (two types) and ticket printer from Poland (available in English, Polish and German)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">83 setvars with 236 options of configuration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">670 realistic and semi realistic repaints of exterior and interior with different upholstery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Realistic 3d model, textures and sounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buses are repaintable</p></li></ul>","developers":["Kajosoft"],"fullgame":{"appid":"252530","name":"OMSI 2: Steam Edition"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837800/bb088bbb26d394dc17ad31216b7f19aaaeac8a09/header.jpg?t=1754396424","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright \u00a9 2013 AEROSOFT. All rights reserved. All trademarks and brand names are trademarks or registered trademarks of the respective owners. Copyrights are serious stuff. If you find any pirated copies of this software please notify us. We will make sure reports of copyrights violation are rewarded. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nAerosoft GmbH<br />\r\nLindberghring 12<br />\r\nD-33142 B\u00fcren, Germany","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true